    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: c5f6ca131460401ab95de785966ce112
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A kamikaze (seeker drone, bloater, burster — any faction): darts at its target, dodging incoming fire on the way, and blows itself up once within 2.5 m (a short fuse and a warning bark: get clear). Best fast, fragile and in groups.'
